x27;•&#x27;]">Enemy runs standard frontline without stacked magic defense. Penetration scales better than shred in even matchups.</span></li><li class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-2 gap-y-1 text-[12.5px] leading-relaxed text-mlbb-text-secondary"><a class="font-heading font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-mlbb-text transition-colors hover:text-mlbb-gold-bright" href="/items/winter-crown">Winter Crown</a><span class="inline-flex items-baseline gap-1.5 text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wide text-mlbb-text-secondary/80"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right relative top-[1px] h-3 w-3 text-text-accent/65" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg><span class="text-mlbb-text-secondary/65">over</span><a class="font-semibold text-text-accent transition-colors hover:text-mlbb-gold-bright" href="/items/blood-wings">Blood Wings</a></span><span class="basis-full text-[12.5px] text-mlbb-text-secondary/90 sm:basis-auto sm:before:mx-1 sm:before:text-mlbb-text-secondary/50 sm:before:content-[&#x27;•&#x27;]">Enemy coordinates multiple divers onto your lane. Carmilla&#x27;s shield plus Frozen buys two survival layers.</span></li><li class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-2 gap-y-1 text-[12.5px] leading-relaxed text-mlbb-text-secondary"><a class="font-heading font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-mlbb-text transition-colors hover:text-mlbb-gold-bright" href="/items/glowing-wand">Glowing Wand</a><span class="inline-flex items-baseline gap-1.5 text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wide text-mlbb-text-secondary/80"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right relative top-[1px] h-3 w-3 text-text-accent/65" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg><span class="text-mlbb-text-secondary/65">over</span><a class="font-semibold text-text-accent transition-colors hover:text-mlbb-gold-bright" href="/items/genius-wand">Genius Wand</a></span><span class="basis-full text-[12.5px] text-mlbb-text-secondary/90 sm:basis-auto sm:before:mx-1 sm:before:text-mlbb-text-secondary/50 sm:before:content-[&#x27;•&#x27;]">Extended sustain fights where Carmilla is tanking and you need the HP burn from range.</span></li></ul></div></div></article></section></div><div id="tabpanel-skins" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-skins" hidden=""></div><div id="tabpanel-lore" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-lore" hidden=""></div><div id="tabpanel-stats" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-stats" tabindex="0" hidden=""><div class="mt-6 md:mt-8"><section id="rank-stats" aria-labelledby="rank-stats-heading" class="relative bg-surface-2/85 backdrop-blur-sm border border-mlbb-gold/20 overflow-hidden" style="box-shadow:0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.03) inset, 0 18px 38px -24px rgba(0,0,0,0.8)"><div class="absolute top-0 left-0 right-0 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-mlbb-gold-bright/55 to-transparent" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-3 h-3 border-t border-l border-mlbb-gold-bright/40" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-3 h-3 border-t border-r border-mlbb-gold/30" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-3 h-3 border-b border-l border-mlbb-gold/30" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-3 h-3 border-b border-r border-mlbb-gold/30" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="relative p-3 sm:p-4 md:p-6"><header class="mb-4 md:mb-5"><h2 id="rank-stats-heading" class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-heading font-bold text-text-accent-bright uppercase tracking-[0.04em] leading-tight">Cecilion Win Rate &amp; Pick Rate by Rank</h2><p class="mt-2 text-text-muted leading-re